core a fictional \"is it urgent?\" machine on 12 tickets. 1 means urgent.\nactual    = [1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0]\npredicted = [1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0]\n\ntp = fp = fn = tn = 0\nfor a, p in zip(actual, predicted):\n    if a == 1 and p == 1:\n        tp += 1\n    elif a == 0 and p == 1:\n        fp += 1\n    elif a == 1 and p == 0:\n        fn += 1\n    else:\n        tn += 1\n\naccuracy = (tp + tn) / (tp + tn + fp + fn)\nprecision = tp / (tp + fp)\nrecall = tp / (tp + fn)\nf1 = 2 * precision * recall / (precision + recall)\nprint(\"tp\", tp, \"fp\", fp, \"fn\", fn, \"tn\", tn)\nprint(\"accuracy\", round(accuracy, 2), \"precision\", round(precision, 2))\nprint(\"recall\", round(recall, 2), \"f1\", round(f1, 2))\n"}